                        "form": "die Bürokraten"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0719f741-d426-38eb-a2ff-a116a5ee1826",
                        "entry_id": "cd22eb27-5aab-32e9-92b8-d51f4478b56f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "jemand, der Vorschriften und Bestimmungen kleinlich genau auslegt und anwendet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8511bc41-bcbc-469f-b426-b124e2c80a71",
                                "sense_id": "0719f741-d426-38eb-a2ff-a116a5ee1826",
                                "text": "Er ist ein überaus kleinlicher Bürokrat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3841c4c2-d510-4cb2-804f-6541e4b2247c",
                                "sense_id": "0719f741-d426-38eb-a2ff-a116a5ee1826",
                                "text": "„Die Fantasie guter Bürokraten ist unerschöpflich.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5627ea43-4938-4a89-913f-5ba4c88f9f29",
                                "sense_id": "0719f741-d426-38eb-a2ff-a116a5ee1826",
                                "text": "„Viele Menschen sind sich gar nicht bewusst, dass die Rundfunkgebühren in Wirklichkeit eine versteckte Steuer sind: Sie werden per Gesetz erhoben und durch staatlich eingesetzte Bürokraten verwaltet.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb695335-2d73-4eb8-80d2-7906115c50d1",
                                "sense_id": "0719f741-d426-38eb-a2ff-a116a5ee1826",
                                "text": "„Der Stellvertreter, mit ganzem Herzen Bürokrat, war mit diesem Arrangement mehr als zufrieden.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1dd84a05-5c39-4f2a-95e7-51ccce8d5659",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd22eb27-5aab-32e9-92b8-d51f4478b56f",
                        "source_sense_id": "0719f741-d426-38eb-a2ff-a116a5ee1826",
                        "source_sense_description": "abwertend: jemand, der Vorschriften und Bestimmungen kleinlich genau auslegt und anwendet",
                        "target_lang_word": "bureaucrat",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bureaucrat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "711e5f9a-3fc7-3e0e-ad9e-ebf4c5783f58",
                                        "entry_id": "86396514-d2a1-32f0-854d-dfb88cf47b48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An official who is part of a bureaucracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5024023b-74a1-435a-b79a-cc53346d67f8",
                                                "sense_id": "711e5f9a-3fc7-3e0e-ad9e-ebf4c5783f58",
                                                "text": "Coristine, who had signed onto the telemeeting using a non-government email address, gave the bureaucrats swift marching orders, telling them he needed access to the federal department’s contract and payment systems before reportedly making them justify their jobs at the $1 billion-budget administration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e94b6aa-a559-4444-98a7-69a659911ac4",
                                                "sense_id": "711e5f9a-3fc7-3e0e-ad9e-ebf4c5783f58",
                                                "text": "At the Oval Office signing ceremony, Musk responded to critiques that he’s become the very thing he claims to be fighting — an unelected bureaucrat with enormous power — by pointing to the 2024 results: “You couldn’t ask for a stronger mandate from the public.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b4201c4-7878-345e-b2ae-267c672be342",
                                        "entry_id": "86396514-d2a1-32f0-854d-dfb88cf47b48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A user on a wiki with the right to change user access levels."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0faf2bc5-4621-49e0-86dc-36c9ec5e361f",
                                                "sense_id": "3b4201c4-7878-345e-b2ae-267c672be342",
                                                "text": "One of three major processes is generally used: a bureaucrat review, a broader community review, or an approvals group review. As only local bureaucrats or Wikimedia stewards can grant the bot flag necessary to operate an authorized bot, the simplest method is to appeal directly to these individuals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ca3dc610-de57-4a32-af26-4f39be063ae6",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd22eb27-5aab-32e9-92b8-d51f4478b56f",
                        "source_sense_id": "0719f741-d426-38eb-a2ff-a116a5ee1826",
                        "source_sense_description": "abwertend: jemand, der Vorschriften und Bestimmungen kleinlich genau auslegt und anwendet",
                        "target_lang_word": "bureaucrate",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bureaucrate",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8403d095-7cae-3214-862e-1511b5d70c48",
                                        "entry_id": "b274ceed-bd74-3ba7-8065-9e801f57b711",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fonctionnaire confiné dans l’atmosphère des bureaux auxquels il attribue une importance exagérée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e51a4f0-7bf2-4d66-8cd5-04a483c164d0",
                                                "sense_id": "8403d095-7cae-3214-862e-1511b5d70c48",
                                                "text": "Savez-vous qu’ils ne gagnent pas plus que les maçons, ces dandies bureaucrates qui n’ont pas voulu être ouvriers et qui sont plus misérables que les ouvriers ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edaa9986-deb2-4e8f-8e52-ef972908bfcb",
                                                "sense_id": "8403d095-7cae-3214-862e-1511b5d70c48",
                                                "text": "Il avait l’air d’un employé égaré dans une contrée sauvage, et involontairement, on eût regardé s’il ne portait pas une plume à son oreille, comme les caissiers, commis, comptables, et autres variétés de la grande famille des bureaucrates."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1404f159-60e2-3a46-a3a5-c2204ebd6d69",
                                        "entry_id": "b274ceed-bd74-3ba7-8065-9e801f57b711",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Statut donné à certains contributeurs des wikis utilisant MediaWiki, élus par la communauté des membres, pour assurer la gestion des comptes du site."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Wikis"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30261cc1-dee7-3455-aa4e-a977611ba453",
                                        "entry_id": "b274ceed-bd74-3ba7-8065-9e801f57b711",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partisan du parti Bureaucrate, soutien de la monarchie britannique et de la Clique du Château."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
